flowchart TD
    I[Request + context + history + catalog] --> P[Planner: ordered tool list]
    P --> L[Executor: next tool in plan]
    L --> A[Code adds required + argument selector]
    A --> V[Value selector uses available env results]
    V --> E[env.validate then env.call]
    E -->|success and more steps| L
    E -->|plan complete and after=done| S[Stop]
    E -->|after=replan in adaptive mode| P
    E -->|env error in adaptive mode| P
    E -->|env error in fixed mode| S
    P -->|ask| Q[env.validate and env.call sys.ask_missing_info]
    Q --> S
    P -->|done| S
